{
  "version": "2.21",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "p3HiqG",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1335,
      "name": "Design notes",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 500,
      "content": "Generator restrictions: shared filter bar + prompt-first trigger cards (HQ m4ffs8szdhkh)\n\nLayout: same as Model Flags and CSAM holds. Flush 400px list, wide detail pane. Header search (debounced, username or user ID).\nTabs = restriction type (Generation / Bot account) with counts. Filters: Status select with count + Sort select, then Origin chips with counts (All / Has a remix / Typed / Unchanged remix). Changing status resets sort to that status's default.\nRows: username + id, age (waiting / ruled), status chip, trigger count, and the origin-mix line (e.g. \"3 remix (unconfirmed) · 1 typed · 5 not recorded\").\n\nPrompt first (Seb, Oct 19: \"make the prompt field stretch all the way to the top of its container\"; it's what the ruling is made on).\nCard order: one-line header (position, origin, repeats, time, False positive) → PROMPT at full card width (14px; title bar carries the why-blocked chips and matched term; footer: character count, re-checked/original toggle, prompt tester, Copy) → negative → evidence (4:5 tiles, 180×225 = the grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 grid from AppealImages: source + input images/video).\nLong prompts (dev data reaches the 6,000-char cap): shown in full up to ~2,500 chars; longer ones fold at ~1,100 (never before the last highlighted match) and \"Show all N characters\" expands in place. No nested scroll. Prompt boxes sit darker than the card.\nPencil can't render inline highlight marks; the app highlights matches inline. ‹term› stands in for blocked words; media are placeholders.\n\nFrames: 1 remix prompt (Pending), 2 typed prompt with Uphold chosen, 3 Upheld read-only with Resolution, 4 empty search. Board below: one card per origin found on dev."
    },
